*pload* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''pload(filename)''

Loads a native plugin shared object.

*Parameters:*
- ''filename'': String path to plugin shared object (''.chipso'')

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success

*Behavior:*
- Plugin functions and constants are namespaced: ''_pluginname_symbolname_''
- Plugin version must match ChipLang version exactly
- Loading same plugin twice returns ''ok'' immediately (no-op)
- All symbols registered atomically (on error, no partial registration)

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if plugin file not found
- Runtime error if plugin missing ''GetPlugin()'' function
- Runtime error if version mismatch
- Runtime error if symbol already exists in global context
- Runtime error if plugin exports duplicate symbols
